    "title": "Arrest made in Rosehill Seafood arson, officials announce - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Colin ,\n11 hours ago Investigators have arrested a man following an investigation into an arson at a popular Columbus restaurant. Brandon Ghant, 27, was arrested and charged with arson in the first degree and criminal damage in the second degree, according to Daniel Macon, the deputy chief for Columbus Fire and EMS. Ghant was arrested by the Columbus Fire and EMS arson investigators. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
